  "title": "Practice 1 — Fire on the 1st North section",
  "statement": "At approximately 7:30 a.m. a fire was reported on the 1st North section. Five miners were working on the section; two escaped and reported light smoke in the No. 2 Entry. Three miners are unaccounted for. The main mine fan, at the air shaft off the No. 4 Entry at Crosscut 5, is running and exhausting. All power to the section has been removed at the power center. The fresh air base has been established at the mouth of the section; the team may enter the section in any of the four entries.",
  "instructions": "Explore the section and locate and account for all missing persons. Bring all live persons to the fresh air base. Do not change the fan without the briefing officer’s approval. Timbers are not provided at the fresh air base.",
